We have a conversation where user previously gave tasks to implement a game based on reference. The assistant wrote index.html and meta.json. It has implemented various sections. Now validation fails because <header> missing <p class="game-description"> and <ul class="game-controls">. The standard structure in the reference example had a header with title, description, and a list of controls.

We need to edit the existing index.html to include these elements (the <p class="game-description"> and <ul class="game-controls">). Also make sure that the controls list matches meta.json's controls.

